<title>USA: Mitsubishi February US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi February US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Feb 1-28, 1997     Feb 1-29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     9,663	     7,483	    +34.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,375	     3,764	    +21.1</p>
<p> Import Truck	     2,913	     1,261	   +140.6</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Feb 28, 1997 Jan 1-Feb 29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    19,363	    20,482	     -3.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		 8,754	     6,548	    +36.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	     4,924	     2,462	   +104.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 50 for year to date vs 51 in year ago.</p>
</text>
